{"id":"5dc6da6f374d15c9","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-fo-reduction-closure.md","title":"一阶归约闭包","display":"df-fo-reduction-closure — 一阶归约闭包","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-fo-reduction-closure","aliases":["29-df-fo-reduction-closure"],"display":"df-fo-reduction-closure — 一阶归约闭包","depends_on":["[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 3.9, pp.48–49, DjVu scans 63–64","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；定义已逐项对照"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-fo-reduction-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-fo-reduction-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fo-reduction-closure — 一阶归约闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 3.9, pp.48–49, DjVu scans 63–64"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；定义已逐项对照"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak Q\">\\(\\mathfrak Q\\)</span> 为固定词汇范围内的布尔查询集合；每个查询携带其输入词汇。跨词汇的一阶多一归约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathfrak Q\">\\(\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathfrak Q\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 为一种逻辑语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathfrak Q\">\\(Q_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathfrak Q\\)</span> 为预先给定的、由该语言定义的布尔查询集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}\\)</span> 是下式引入的闭包性质，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak Q\">\\(\\mathfrak Q\\)</span> 本身包含任意词汇上的全部查询。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}(\\mathcal S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in\\mathfrak Q\\;\n\\bigl((\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal S\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}(\\mathcal S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in\\mathfrak Q\\;\n\\bigl((\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal S\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOClosedLang}_{\\mathfrak Q}(\\mathcal L,Q_{\\mathcal L})\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}(Q_{\\mathcal L}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FOClosedLang}_{\\mathfrak Q}(\\mathcal L,Q_{\\mathcal L})\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}(Q_{\\mathcal L}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 3.9，印刷页48–49、扫描页63–64。语言闭包是其可定义查询集的语义性质；这与“两个 FO 结构查询的复合仍为 FO 查询”是两个不同对象。已有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83f36b68a9cb059f\" href=\"?note=83f36b68a9cb059f\" title=\"29-prop-fo-closure\">29-prop-fo-closure</a> 处理后者，不能代替本定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak Q\">\\(\\mathfrak Q\\)</span> 的范围显式给定，使多词汇资源类和固定词汇子问题都能合法使用该接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-first-order-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak Q$ 为固定词汇范围内的布尔查询集合；每个查询携带其输入词汇。跨词汇的一阶多一归约 $\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}$ 见 [[29-df-first-order-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-prop-fo-closure","status":"resolved","id":"83f36b68a9cb059f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Definition 3.9，印刷页48–49、扫描页63–64。语言闭包是其可定义查询集的语义性质；这与“两个 FO 结构查询的复合仍为 FO 查询”是两个不同对象。已有 [[29-prop-fo-closure]] 处理后者，不能代替本定义。$\\mathfrak Q$ 的范围显式给定，使多词汇资源类和固定词汇子问题都能合法使用该接口。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathfrak Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathfrak Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}(\\mathcal S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in\\mathfrak Q\\;\n\\bigl((\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\mathcal A\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo}}\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal S\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOClosedLang}_{\\mathfrak Q}(\\mathcal L,Q_{\\mathcal L})\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{FOClosed}_{\\mathfrak Q}(Q_{\\mathcal L}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak Q","display":false}],"bytes":1787,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-reduction-closure]]、[[29-thm-completeness-capture]] — 归约闭包与完全问题捕获范式"},{"id":"b4d40e46b998c6d5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-fo-reduction-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["65b448b4269ca18e","83f36b68a9cb059f"]}